Sentry is off by default and only useful for Mudlet devs.
For:							Need:
Crash reports appear in Sentry	WITH_SENTRY=ON + SENTRY_DSN=...
Symbolicated stack traces		Also SENTRY_DEBUG=ON + SENTRY_AUTH_TOKEN=...

enabling SENTRY requires a DSN, and SENTRY_DEBUG additionally requires an auth token.

# Example when building the port
make SENTRY_DSN="https://xxxxxxxx@oXXXX.ingest.sentry.io/XXXXXXX" \
     SENTRY_AUTH_TOKEN="sntrys_xxxxxxxx" \
     WITH=SENTRY,SENTRY_DEBUG
